始約虜入馬邑城，兵與單于接，而臣擊其輜重，可得利。今單于聞，不至而還，臣以三萬人眾不敵，禔取辱耳。臣固知還而斬，然得完陛下士三萬人。」於是下恢廷尉。廷尉當恢逗橈，當斬。恢私行千金丞相蚡。蚡不敢言上，而言於太后曰：「王恢首造馬邑事，今不成而誅恢，是爲匈奴報仇也。」上朝太后，太后以丞相言告上。上曰：「首爲馬邑事者，恢也，故發天下兵數十萬，從其言，爲此。且縱單于不可得，恢所部擊其輜重，猶頗可得，以慰士大夫心。今不誅恢，無以謝天下。」於是恢聞之，乃自殺。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"zgv_3zp_3tg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0093","start":93,"end":94,"surface":"恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"廷尉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"下恢廷尉為司法機構；廷尉當恢可為機構或未名官員，不據官稱補個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"廷尉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"下恢廷尉為司法機構；廷尉當恢可為機構或未名官員，不據官稱補個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0100","start":100,"end":101,"surface":"恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0107","start":107,"end":108,"surface":"恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0114","start":11